   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">Dear ShinyApps users,</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">We are happy to announce improvements to the </span><a href=\"https://www.shinyapps.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.shinyapps.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364766883000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Pc8CDiO1JqeH3Ob8WCntF\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">shinyapps.io</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"> service over the past few weeks. These include:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Support for BioConductor-based packages</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Speed improvements on first-time builds of your applications</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Support for more concurrent connections</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Support for R packages that require the quantlib library</span></p></li></ul><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap\">BioConductor support</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">You can now use your favorite packages from BioConductor and deploy them to </span><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364766883000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QCjQ4djq_lM5EBLjjTUxb\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(102,17,204);white-space:pre-wrap\">shinyapps.io</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">. Simply take any locally running shiny application or </span><a href=\"http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364766883000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xeT9dYN-ybKRHOoiTaWB3\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(51,51,51);text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">R markdown</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\"> document and deploy it via deployApp(). The shinyapps package you create will identify the dependencies and pass them along to </span><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364766883000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QCjQ4djq_lM5EBLjjTUxb\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(102,17,204);white-space:pre-wrap\">shinyapps.io</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">Note: You will need to upgrade to the latest version of the shinyapps package by running the R command:</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:italic;white-space:pre-wrap\">devtools::install_github(“rstudio/shinyapps”)</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap\">Faster build times</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">The time it takes for an app to deploy </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">the first tim</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration:line-through;white-space:pre-wrap\">e</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"> has been improved significantly due to improved caching of packages.  For the most common packages used, the performance of the build is now almost 5x faster. This improvement took effect last week. You don’t need to do anything to take advantage of it. Most app deployments are just faster now!</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap\">More concurrent connections per application</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">We have increased the limit on the number of concurrent connections that can be handled by an R process from 20 to 100.  </span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap\">Quantlib support</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">For users interested in using libraries like </span><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RQuantLib/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RQuantLib/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364766883000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WRZ6fpZ-Rbcj4L_7-bdro\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">RQuantLib</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">, <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364766883000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QCjQ4djq_lM5EBLjjTUxb\">shinyapps.io</a> now bundles the underlying quantlib libraries into the core of the service making that possible.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">Thank you all for your help in improving the</span><a href=\"http://shinyapps.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364766883000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0OCe8LeQe9zzKTnRMHiMVx\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(102,17,204);white-space:pre-wrap\">shinyapps.io</span></a><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"> platform.  We hope you like these enhancements and we look forward to your feedback as always.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">Best,</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">The ShinyApps team   </span></p><br></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
